I'll start with one I see Stacy
Wilber from facebook says,

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.300
can you please put in an adult program

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.090
so adults can get their diplomas please.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.510
Stacy that's one of the
dreams of Khan Academy.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:52.570
We don't issue things like diplomas

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.700
but I do we do know a lot of stories

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.310
about especially adults
leveraging Khan Academy

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:01.340
