00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:14.560
will inform the software even more

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.590
what your strengths and weaknesses are.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.400
So I would go there and I know we have,

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.510
you know the next SCT
administration got canceled

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:24.380
