00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:36.430
And I would say at least once a week

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.030
try to take a full-length practice test.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.930
We're seeing that is also a best practice

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.190
that helps a lot of students.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.750
And when you take that practice test,

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:47.510
try to take it in as most
realistic circumstances as you can

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.003
so yes, spend some time on
our official SAT practice.

