00:29:13.440 --> 00:29:16.060
to what the factor is
it's being multiplied

00:29:16.060 --> 00:29:17.830
over any time period
and exponential growth.

00:29:17.830 --> 00:29:20.550
So I think you know if if
there's a silver lining here,

00:29:20.550 --> 00:29:22.220
everyone should get out of this crisis

00:29:22.220 --> 00:29:24.003
